cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use the Ontology Companion Generator in your research, please cite it as below.
title: "Ontology Companion Generator (OCG)"
abstract: >-
  A config-first Node.js package that generates a GitHub Pages companion site for an
  ontology or vocabulary, including reference, terms, graph, artifact, optional ReSpec
  specification, and usage guide pages with embedded JSON-LD, plus optional w3id.org
  content negotiation and OOPS! ontology pitfall reporting.
type: software
authors:
